/-! ### Copied from `scratch/obj-bridge/Objects.lean` §C-§F (lines 1129-1795; its copies of pkg-I3 and pkg-I2, §A-§B, dropped in favour of this file's `PkgI3`, `PkgI2`; hsyn-fold). -/

